+      /*
+       * Free 2D panning.
+       * touch-action: none on the viewport disables the browser's native touch
+       * scrolling (which often locks to a single axis), so we translate every
+       * pointer movement into BOTH scrollLeft and scrollTop changes ourselves.
+       * The user can pan diagonally and change direction mid-gesture freely.
+       * Mouse wheel / trackpad scrolling keeps working natively on both axes.
